Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a big checkbook too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.16,0:19:08.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, you did mention 30 trillion dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:10.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.87,0:19:13.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.50,0:19:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:24.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The the thing I recommend most for for every employee Nvidia every company CEO that I meet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.48,0:19:31.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,every leader that I meet is engage artificial intelligence try to have a tactical feel for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:36.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um this mystical thing is not so mystical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:43.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,In its extreme of course it's as mystical as you and I sitting here having conversations with each
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.56,0:19:50.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,other and it turns out there's there are several things that we should observe about about artificial intelligence today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:58.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,We we have through invention of technology the most advanced computing technology ever created.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:03.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have made the computer easier to use than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:08.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,To the point where almost anybody can talk to the computer, prompt it for something,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.32,0:20:15.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,ask it to do something for you, including write software for you, and it will write software for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.44,0:20:20.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it could make drawings for you, could create schematics for you, could make charts and graphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:25.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could read something for you, translate something for you, summarize something for you, solve problems for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.75,0:20:30.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this incredible thing, this computer, is is now democratized.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:33.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,For the very first time in history, this incredible system,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.00,0:20:41.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,this incredible technology is available to just a small percentage of the of the world, is now available to everybody to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:47.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the the first thing to do is is to try to understand how how you could take advantage of this technology yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:50.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, of course, once you you go down that journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:54.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,you'll discover all the same things that that scientists and engineers and all
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.10,0:20:58.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,of us are starting to discover that not only is it more energy efficient,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:21:03.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,um we can use our energy better, we could be more energy sustainable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.91,0:21:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It could create new materials so that we could we could create sustainable energy more efficiently effectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.84,0:21:12.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Some of the important work that we're doing in carbon capture,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.35,0:21:20.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,just trying to figure out in a reservoir how much pressure can we pump into carbon into this reservoir,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.96,0:21:26.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,and how much how much this reservoir has already been saturated with carbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:31.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we could select the best injection wells for carbon capture.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.93,0:21:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this simulation takes supercomputers just an enormous amount of calculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.16,0:21:43.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've taught an AI how to go help us select these sites with nearly a million times less energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.79,0:21:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so there's a lot of different ways that we can use artificial intelligence to to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:53.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Being inspired by those ideas, I think would really help um DOE.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.78,0:21:59.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And And of course, some of the things that that I would recommend is invest in using it yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.16,0:22:08.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, one of the things that that I would really love to see the United States do is for the government to to become a practitioner of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.76,0:22:11.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't just be a governor of AI, be a practitioner of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.00,0:22:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um the DOE, the DOD, you know, every single department, be a practitioner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.56,0:22:21.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and build an AI supercomputer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.29,0:22:29.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh the scientists would be more than happy to jump on it and create new AI algorithms, you know, to advance our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.39,0:22:30.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.46,0:22:36.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, obviously you were, you know, a startup innovator many moons ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.48,0:22:42.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you all have affinity for that as a company through your inception partnership network.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.23,0:22:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Talk about that and how you see that ecosystem of of innovators.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:50.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, we know a lot about this technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.20,0:22:53.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um we have a lot of scale and resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:56.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we have we have abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.97,0:23:05.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so So, when we see companies around the world that are trying to apply AI for some particular domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.40,0:23:07.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,it could be a domain like, for example, Uli data.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.44,0:23:09.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm just really love that company.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.55,0:23:16.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're They're a company that wanted to build a smart grid, but they didn't understand artificial intelligence that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.26,0:23:22.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so working together, we became an expert in artificial intelligence and the application for smart grids.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.12,0:23:28.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh we work uh uh with a company that's that has satellites out in space.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and that's where satellites go where satellites I mean, even I knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.92,0:23:40.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,It takes It takes a CEO to tell you those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.84,0:23:47.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and uh and and these are these are they take images of the
