Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.76,0:24:03.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, we can't see anything from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.60,0:24:05.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,We teach an AI how to see something from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.62,0:24:09.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,And discovers gas leaks and and reservoir leaks and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.89,0:24:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,I mean, we could we could there are all kinds of things we could these companies have imaginations to do and we could, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.44,0:24:23.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,help them with our AI capabilities and so we're working with thousands of startups come And
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.27,0:24:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,do they find them or do you find you find them or do they find you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.72,0:24:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sometimes we find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.97,0:24:29.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sometimes we find them, they find us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.95,0:24:31.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Often times I even find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.42,0:24:35.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, but I read about them and here's a company that's doing some really interesting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.00,0:24:43.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, the the company that's, you know, watching out for for keeping birds safe in the middle of a wind farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.85,0:24:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so yeah, all kinds of great ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.28,0:24:49.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uh you won't be surprised to that I'm going to ask you about workforce.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.80,0:24:57.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of obviously implications to the good and a lot of fear around what is the meaning of AI for our American workforce
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.67,0:25:05.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,or our workforce globally obviously and how you think about that as your own human capital asset as a company and how you develop and grow,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.31,0:25:13.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,but also, you know, the broader implications for the workforce first in the US, but but in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.84,0:25:18.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first thing we need to do is demystify this technology for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.64,0:25:21.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because it's useful to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.84,0:25:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can empower them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.20,0:25:26.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,But not if they don't understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.44,0:25:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And as it turns out, it's actually relatively easy to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.28,0:25:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very few people in the world know how to program a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.04,0:25:39.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,But everyone knows that knows how to ask someone else to do something for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.36,0:25:41.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.20,0:25:44.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's as simple as walking up to computer and tell it, you know, what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.04,0:25:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And for the first time it might even give you a reasonable answer back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.36,0:25:50.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you don't even need complete sentences.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.60,0:25:52.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can be grammatically incorrect.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.19,0:25:54.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,You just, you know, and start.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.06,0:25:59.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,And if it doesn't understand uh what you mean, it'll actually ask you back what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.75,0:26:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And just go back and forth until it figures out what you want and it does it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.64,0:26:05.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.05,0:26:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,we have demystified we we need to demystify artificial intelligence so we can empower the population to take
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.40,0:26:17.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,advantage of this amazing technology that's only been available for a few percentage of the world in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.97,0:26:20.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we could close the technology divide.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.72,0:26:22.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,We could enable everybody to take advantage of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.81,0:26:27.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the first thing that we've done is we've we teach a class called Deep Learning Institute.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.47,0:26:37.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we go around the world and we we're doing we're doing a very large campaign in California in school in community colleges
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.06,0:26:44.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,and high schools and such and and and anybody who would like to learn to teach them about about the capabilities of artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.84,0:26:47.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,We should do that all over the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.16,0:26:50.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,We should be teaching everybody um exposing people to this technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.75,0:26:53.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I think it's easy to use, it's fun to use, inspiring to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.00,0:26:59.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You could ask it to help you draw something, give you a recipe, you know, help you write a business plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.68,0:27:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, all kinds of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.12,0:27:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,But obviously there's no substitute for the ability to to read and and cipher and compute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.41,0:27:12.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I know you all have been involved in in education programs at your alma maters and so forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.67,0:27:18.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,But how do you think about your own human capital and what do you look for in your in your people and your leaders?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.23,0:27:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is it Is it you know, given all the promise that AI has for the workforce, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.72,0:27:29.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,what are you looking for as you look for and recruit leaders and people to join you in building Nvidia?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.92,0:27:32.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the same things I look for in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.16,0:27:33.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um nothing's going to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.36,0:27:38.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,The one thing that's going to change is is the amount of software programming that we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.06,0:27:40.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,The actual programming that we do will reduce.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.59,0:27:44.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or another way of saying it is the way we program computers will change.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.51,0:27:46.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because you're just going to ask the computer to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.56,0:27:47.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.60,0:27:48.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:53.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're going to describe very clearly what we want the computer to help us do, and the computer will do it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.87,0:28:00.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the way that we would design chips in the future will be describing probably the specifications of the chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.96,0:28:06.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Which is telling somebody what you want is is often times where the genius is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.88,0:28:07.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.19,0:28:07.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.49,0:28:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, where the genius is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.68,0:28:17.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, doing it doing doing the actual skill, of course, there's great craft and and great dedication and um but, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.74,0:28:27.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,to to to be able to explain a future that you would like to create and have have AIs that that help you go do that is is pretty terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.88,0:28:31.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so my prediction is is that the first thing the first thing
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.90,0:28:36.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,companies like ourselves would do is use artificial intelligence to improve our productivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.79,0:28:38.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's what we've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.21,0:28:45.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've got AIs all over our companies designing our chips, writing our software, helping us debug things, help us do verification.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.84,0:28:50.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,We're starting to work on using it for marketing and customer support and things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.72,0:28:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so number one, help us be more productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.93,0:28:57.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,When a company becomes more productive, they make more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.74,0:29:00.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,When they make more money, they hire more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.76,0:29:04.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is because we have more ideas we'd like to go pursue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.08,0:29:07.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I would love for the United States to be more productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.62,0:29:09.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because we'll have more money.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.27,0:29:13.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And then we'll because we have abundance of ideas, we'll be more prosperous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.36,0:29:21.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so So, I I think the the the idea the idea that that it's it's human versus AI is not quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.52,0:29:23.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's humans using AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:31.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,And with respect to anybody who who is concerned about an AI taking their job, you should probably worry about someone who uses AI taking your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.99,0:29:32.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.38,0:29:42.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so So, that that reminds you to to get going and to go learn this learn this new tool and to make this new tool, you know, your advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.63,0:29:45.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,And surely as a company we're going to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.22,0:29:46.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah. a country we should do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.01,0:29:52.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and obviously what are those skills that are necessary to be able to be precise and
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.60,0:29:56.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,you know at at the telling what to do That's right. part of the the AI equation.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.96,0:29:57.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.96,0:29:58.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.36,0:30:00.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Okay, national security.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.36,0:30:00.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.80,0:30:07.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Obviously, you know, a huge you know nexus between our nation's security and and these issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.69,0:30:13.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Talk about that how you see the world and and the national security implications for this technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.58,0:30:24.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Taking a step back, um countries are starting to awaken to the importance of artificial intelligence to their country.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.82,0:30:25.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.08,0:30:28.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,On first principles, it is apparent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.82,0:30:30.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the reason for that is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.91,0:30:38.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,No country in the world would say uh we should outsource our intelligence to anybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.14,0:30:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,No country in the world should say would say, "We have an abundance of intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.00,0:30:44.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is good enough."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.50,0:30:44.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.84,0:30:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's put a lid on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.80,0:30:53.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's wean ourself off of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.08,0:31:02.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so I think I think it's it's now very clear that the that artificial intelligence is about the the accelerated production of intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.32,0:31:03.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.08,0:31:08.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Please remind me to to talk about artificial intelligence as an industry and the production of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.04,0:31:12.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,I just want to because for energy is so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.38,0:31:20.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and countries are also starting to realize that the land they're on is part of their natural resource and sovereign resource,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.35,0:31:29.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,but their language, culture, people, their way of thinking Right. is part of their natural resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.64,0:31:33.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's that is codified in data.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.20,0:31:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.73,0:31:43.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so to to allow other countries to come in and scrape your data, harvest your data, harvest your natural resource, Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.56,0:31:49.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,refine it and then import it back to you as artificial intelligence is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.24,0:31:50.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.52,0:31:51.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.54,0:31:58.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so countries are starting to realize that they have to take control of their own artificial intelligence production.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:32:03.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is where the word sovereign AI, if you will, is starting to float around.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.36,0:32:13.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Countries in the in the west, countries in the east are quite concerned and quite motivated to secure their AI infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.16,0:32:21.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just like they secured their their telecommunications, their power grids, their nuclear assets, their their nuclear assets.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.17,0:32:24.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,They want to really secure their artificial intelligence infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.91,0:32:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that's that's really one of the the major dynamics that's happening around the world
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.28,0:32:38.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,that that they realize now the incredible potential of this technology to accelerate their uh climbing,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.24,0:32:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you will, you know, in the world's um various social ladders.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.53,0:32:51.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is a a great tool for them to propel their national prosperity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.32,0:33:00.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and I so I think on on first principles people now understand the incredible importance of artificial intelligence for their national security,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.45,0:33:03.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,national prosperity, and national development.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.88,0:33:04.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.04,0:33:08.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so I think I think every country is starting to to realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.35,0:33:15.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now, from our United States, we need to realize that this technology is is indigenous to us, is was created here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.08,0:33:16.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.24,0:33:16.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.72,0:33:24.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and we're proud to be an American company and uh if not for United States and and all of the resource that that was that was made available,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.24,0:33:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,uh Nvidia wouldn't be prob- wouldn't be possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.12,0:33:38.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so I I think the the the um uh uh the the country's desire uh to uh number one,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.82,0:33:43.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,protect this technology uh for our own benefit, uh it is fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.88,0:33:49.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we want to use this technology, of course, to accelerate and propel the United States further.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.28,0:33:53.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,The important thing is to realize also that to balance that with the idea
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.04,0:33:59.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,that that American technology around the world sets American standards all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.68,0:34:01.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.15,0:34:05.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,We would like we It's fantastic that the world speaks English.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.42,0:34:11.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's fantastic that that the world is is powered by American technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.36,0:34:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we would like, of course, Nvidia tech- technology to also be used all over the world to set the pace for the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.41,0:34:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,um to make sure that the American technologies are used to build other nations and other industries around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.60,0:34:32.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we want to find a balance between national security and, of course, prosperity for American companies around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.03,0:34:40.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so that balance is hard to strike and but whatever whatever the administration does, of course, is something we'll support.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.64,0:34:40.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.98,0:34:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I want to ask you about regulation and and the role in that, but you were going to say for a second about AI production.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.80,0:34:50.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the big observation from an energy perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.96,0:34:52.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is really important to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.84,0:34:59.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um for the very first time a computer is a tool, but it's also a factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.72,0:35:00.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.08,0:35:04.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,It used to be a data center where data stored.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.32,0:35:13.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in the future, these computers that we build um will be used in a way that's very different than the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.32,0:35:15.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,These computers, for example, I have a I have a phone in my pocket right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.04,0:35:17.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.44,0:35:18.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,And it's a tool of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.03,0:35:23.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just like a Cuisinart, just a lawnmower, just like anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.10,0:35:23.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Any other tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.76,0:35:24.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,My phone's a tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.65,0:35:26.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you're using it, you're using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.28,0:35:27.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you're not using it, it's sitting idle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.00,0:35:30.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,My phone's sitting idle right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.16,0:35:37.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,However, in the world of artificial intelligence, there will be systems, there will be AIs that are doing things for us all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.84,0:35:40.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,We ask it to go do something and it does it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.52,0:35:44.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just like we ask one of our employees to do something, it does it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.52,0:35:55.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and uh we like it to be human in the loop, but as autonomous as as autonomous as possible, as governed as necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.12,0:36:03.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so these computers are off working on things, designing chips, writing software, optimizing things, going through plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.58,0:36:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,evaluating all the various plans that we have and trying to figure out which one is the best to come back and recommend it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.93,0:36:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so the exploration of the design space,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.40,0:36:23.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,exploration of the the the optimization space is really really large and we want these AIs to go explore to go look for new scientific discovery,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.05,0:36:23.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.86,0:36:27.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so it's off in the in these machines and it's running all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.97,0:36:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,In a lot of ways, these computers in the future will be an AI factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.32,0:36:32.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.85,0:36:36.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,And there's a new factory that is being created right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.66,0:36:40.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a new industry that's that's being created right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.16,0:36:41.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's called AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.20,0:36:41.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.66,0:36:45.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,And remember, a new industry requires energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.58,0:36:48.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,And this is a new addition to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.80,0:36:57.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so while accelerated computing what Nvidia does, um allows us to save a lot of energy in the way that we use the compute.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.58,0:37:02.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,So every every every software that can be accelerated should be accelerated.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.77,0:37:11.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um we should modernize old data centers with a new type of computing models that are accelerated and we'll save a lot of energy in doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.73,0:37:13.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that's a classical data center.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.35,0:37:14.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,That what that's what we used to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.86,0:37:19.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,But there's a new thing that's called AI factories and that's going to consume energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.57,0:37:24.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,but what of course comes out of it is artificial intelligence that will help us save energy somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.96,0:37:25.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.38,0:37:29.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so this is a this is a, if you will, an industrial revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.32,0:37:33.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,assembly line, a new you you used your car analogy a bit ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.25,0:37:34.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,A new factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.24,0:37:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,So regulations and guardrails and policy making, you know, there's a lot of energy on the hill and and rightly about how do we think about, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.52,0:37:48.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,preserving innovation while protecting national security, our children, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.02,0:37:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,fill in the blank, and our role in the world vis-a-vis the Europeans or others.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.93,0:37:57.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah, how do you think about those issues as, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.73,0:38:04.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,members of the Congress down the street here start to put pen to paper on the way forward for your industry?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.31,0:38:12.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, first to help them understand the technology, all of the potential incredible good that it can do around the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.84,0:38:18.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,recognizing the the the threats and the danger of this this technology, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.32,0:38:28.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um The technology is fundamentally intelligence and intelligence could be used in a lot of different ways for for great and for peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.54,0:38:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so and so we we one, help them understand the state of the technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.01,0:38:34.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are we today?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.68,0:38:38.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um where would it be in some reasonable time?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.16,0:38:46.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,And how to how to think about the technology more practically instead of theoretically Mhm. sci- science fiction wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.16,0:38:46.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.82,0:38:51.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so without without us demystifying it, it's hard for people to understand this technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.63,0:38:54.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so one, help people understand the technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.49,0:38:59.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um help people understand the the the very very good use that's already coming out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.19,0:39:04.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and in various fields of science where there's in health care or
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.19,0:39:09.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,um climate science or education education or everybody should have their own tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.24,0:39:12.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um and so I have my own tutor today.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.11,0:39:13.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,And my tutor is Perplexity.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.01,0:39:15.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I I use it almost every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.28,0:39:16.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,What what is this tutor?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.92,0:39:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perplexity.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.56,0:39:18.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perplexity.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.21,0:39:18.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perplexity.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.85,0:39:21.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's a great It's a great great great resource.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.55,0:39:31.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Um it's an AI and calls upon other AIs and and um uh you could ask it all kinds of questions and it's really really really helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.58,0:39:38.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Anyways, it's taught me a lot about about about digital biology and so it's really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.36,0:39:40.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you're obviously a half half full guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.82,0:39:41.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,So one, one,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.90,0:39:47.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,make sure that that that we educate them about about the opportunities around
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.15,0:39:54.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,the world so that they understand that exporting American technology is winning abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.60,0:39:55.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we want to win here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.02,0:39:57.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want to win abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.40,0:40:03.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,We want to win everywhere and and all of the policy makers I've met wants America to win and that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.85,0:40:05.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.36,0:40:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,But there is the you know the other side of the coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.92,0:40:12.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,We hosted Brad Smith from Microsoft I don't know a few weeks ago and they released
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.02,0:40:18.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,a report on on AI generated content the implications for kids and others and so forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.11,0:40:23.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,So you know what do you what about that you know keeps you up at night piece of it the darker side of AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.11,0:40:24.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you think of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.87,0:40:33.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well it's I it's going to take AI to catch darker side of AI and and the reason for that is is pretty clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.84,0:40:43.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,They AI is going to be producing fake fake data and and false information at very high speeds
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.97,0:40:50.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,and so you have to take somebody with very high speeds to detect that and to shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.45,0:40:51.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Higher speeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.56,0:40:52.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Higher speeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.40,0:40:53.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.18,0:40:53.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.68,0:41:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so so so I think this is this is very similar to cyber cyber security.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.13,0:41:08.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,It it you're almost every single company and every single country is being hacked hacked and you know attacked at almost all times and so it's
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.98,0:41:17.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,going to take even better cyber security to defend ourselves and so I think the um we just have to make sure that we stay ahead.
