Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.80,0:44:31.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Obviously saw some very exciting news last week with Microsoft helping Constellation reopen
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.63,0:44:35.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,Three Mile Island and the power of nuclear to potentially help this AI future.
