Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.08,0:44:46.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nuclear nuclear is going to be a vital integral part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.14,0:44:50.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,No one no one energy source will be sufficient for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.99,0:44:51.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.36,0:44:54.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so we'll have to find that balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.28,0:45:05.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's it's not one particular way versus others but but there are a lot of good ways and and but there's no better way than to not waste energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.52,0:45:10.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and there there are a couple of ways that that we can contribute to doing that.
