Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.36,0:45:58.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and that power grid could benefit from the insertion of artificial intelligence and smart technology into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.70,0:46:05.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,And that smart grid that grid when become smart will help us properly provision technology
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.77,0:46:11.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the right places and you know connect the right sources and sinks like we connect
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.40,0:46:23.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,the right drivers and writers you know and so in order for Uber to work you need a smart grid and and we could we can go create that smart grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.06,0:46:24.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.23,0:46:25.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Others.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.28,0:46:28.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Colin McCormick from Georgetown University and Carbon Direct.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.26,0:46:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,One of the huge challenges with renewable energy today is the interconnection queue.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.20,0:46:39.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,We have thousands of gigawatts of solar wind and batteries waiting to connect sometimes for years for studies to be completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.80,0:46:48.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,What can tech companies like Nvidia do to speed up the interconnection queue and get that renewable energy generating faster than it is today?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.84,0:46:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.04,0:47:00.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You you know the reason why fossil fuel is so effective is because time mother nature compressed it into a transportable form form for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.28,0:47:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we can take it anywhere and refine it from anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.24,0:47:14.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the challenge of course with electric energy is the battery costs a lot of money and and solar and sun is only out for about half of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.92,0:47:19.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,And and so there there are a variety of of challenges of sustainable energy in that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.84,0:47:25.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,One way that I described earlier is instead of transporting the energy to
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.06,0:47:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,where we need it let's transport the data center to where there's energy source.
