Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.12,0:50:50.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,realize that the AI is running an AI factory and training an AI doesn't have to be like running a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.28,0:50:54.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,It doesn't need to have 99.999999% uptime.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.98,0:50:55.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mhm.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.32,0:51:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, if it's down if it's down a couple of percent, you know, 5% from time to time, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.72,0:51:04.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.19,0:51:09.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You know, it just stops studying for a few hours, you know, and you'll pick up where you left off.
