Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.64,0:52:51.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We we want every everyone to enjoy this quality of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.49,0:52:51.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.82,0:52:53.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,And so, Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.52,0:52:54.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Amen.
