Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.28,0:53:06.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Mr. Jensen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.38,0:53:10.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,Really appreciate your commentary today and I want to touch on one of your critical points,
