Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.19,0:53:17.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,So, my name is Amit Elazari.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.66,0:53:22.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I come from the tech policy profession previously at Intel and today I'm a startup founder,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.00,0:53:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,co-founder of a company called Open Policy and we use AI and work with some of the best unicorns
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.84,0:53:33.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the world to better connect them to what's coming from policy and be able to scale policy engagement,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.24,0:53:38.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,a profession that has, uh, you know, some special expertise that requires that translation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.92,0:53:44.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I want to ask your opinion on how AI can be used to scale, uh, think tank work,
