Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.84,0:54:27.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,The um, AI has a wonderful ability to teach, to explain very complicated concepts.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.72,0:54:35.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,And I use AI today to as I was mentioning to Margaret that I use it literally every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.00,0:54:41.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,I literally use AI every single day and I use it to explain things to me.
